OL,3,GNEWSAWhat should happen when Debenhams
OL,4,Ais demolished?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Debenhams store in Ipswich
OL,7,Fis due to be demolished after the local
OL,8,Fauthority spent millions buying the
OL,9,Flong-term empty building.
OL,11,FIpswich Borough Council has made
OL,12,Fconsiderable investment in the Cornhill
OL,13,Farea of the town but Waterloo House,
OL,14,Fwhich housed the department store for
OL,15,Fdecades, has been a very visible
OL,16,Feyesore since it was sold in 2021.
OL,18,FAfter it was emptied of all the old
OL,19,FDebenhams stock and displays, it stood
OL,20,Fvacant, with metal railings running
OL,21,Falong Ipswich's main pedestrianised
OL,22,Fshopping street.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
