OL,3,GNEWSAWhat should happen when Debenhams
OL,4,Ais demolished?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-run council is spending
OL,7,F#5.5m, from a government grant, to buy
OL,8,Fthe building and then knock it down -
OL,9,Fbut what do local people make of the
OL,10,Fmove?
